 681:       // as pinyin input) its content mutates on every keystroke, but its height
 682:       // barely changes. Dropping the cached height mid-edit would fall back to
 683:       // the document-wide average height for one frame, repositioning every
 684:       // following block — a visible flicker of the content below the caret. The
 685:       // real (possibly unchanged) height is reconciled on the next frame by the
 686:       // measured-block widget, so leaving the stale value yields one frame of a
 687:       // near-correct height instead of one frame of a wrong average.
 688:       final dirty = widget.controller.lastChangedBlockIds;
